# SmartGrid AI Configuration
# ===========================
# By default, SmartGrid AI connects to public real-time data sources with NO API key needed:
#   - Electricity Demand & Generation: MERIT India / POSOCO / NLDC (https://meritindia.in/)
#   - Weather Telemetry & 24h Forecast: Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com/)

# Optional: Legacy OpenWeatherMap key (fallback only, not required)
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweather_api_key_here
